   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceText> "If, after cessation of hydrocortisone, there is redevelopment of septic shock due to CAP (as defined above), then hydrocortisone IV 50 mg every 6 hours is to be recommenced until resolution." ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/occurrenceKind> "intervention"
 ] .

[ rdf:type owl:Axiom ;
