   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceSection> "8.3.4" ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceText> "Administration of a systemic corticosteroid, including hydrocortisone or dexamethasone, after completion of the 10-day course is permitted only for the treatment of new illnesses that develop in the course of a patient’s hospital stay, such as asthma, airway swelling or treatment of an allergic reaction." ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/occurrenceKind> "intervention"
 ] .

