   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceText> "Patients enrolled in previous versions of this DSA to the 10-day oseltamivir intervention will continue to be nested with the 5-day oseltamivir intervention." ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/occurrenceKind> "allocation_nesting"
