   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceText> "If no local guideline exists, recommendations based on estimated Glomerular Filtration Rate (eGFR) are as follows: Hemo(dia)filtration Hemo(dia)filtration Agent eGFR <30 ml/min (1-1.8 L/hr exchange) (>1.8 L/hr exchange) Oseltamivir 30 mg twice daily 30 mg twice daily 75 mg, twice daily Dosing for children is as per local guidelines." ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/occurrenceKind> "intervention"
 ] .

