   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceText> "The domain-specific secondary outcome measures (occurring during the index hospitalization, censored at 90 days after enrollment) will be:" ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/occurrenceKind> "endpoint_secondary"
 ] .


