   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceText> "Eligibility within these strata may be further constrained by domain-specific eligibility criteria specified below." ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/occurrenceKind> "applicability_age"
 ] .

