   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceText> "Receiving respiratory support with high-flow nasal oxygen (HFNO) at a flow rate of at least 30 liters per minute (or at least 2 liters per minute per kilogram of bodyweight in children less than 15 kilograms) OR invasive mechanical ventilation (IMV), non-invasive ventilation (NIV) or continuous positive airways pressure (CPAP) with PEEP or CPAP ≥5cm H 2 O. (This criterion is not required in resource-limited settings where none of these modalities are available)" ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/occurrenceKind> "category_clinical_feature"
