   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceSection> "3.1" ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceText> "For the presence of a pathogen to be ‘confirmed’ or ‘excluded’, there must be supportive microbiological testing." ;
