   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceText> "For the purposes of eligibility, domains may include patients with differing likelihood thresholds for the same pathogen (e.g., one domain may include patients with suspected or confirmed influenza infection and another may constrain eligibility to confirmed infection only)." ;
   <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/occurrenceKind> "category_pathogen"
