###  https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/delegation-2a90ff1b25
<https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/delegation-2a90ff1b25> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
