###  https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/delegation-cdb7e701f1
<https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/delegation-cdb7e701f1> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                                                  <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/DelegationReading> ;
