                                                                                                         <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/coreSentence40> "Whether nested analysis will be performed and, if so, the membership of category of more similar interventions will be specified in the DSA." ;
                                                                                                         <https://kerfors.github.io/early-clinical-design-research/remapcap-design-modules/evidenceDoc> "COVID-19 Immunoglobulin Therapy Domain-Specific Appendix 4" ;
